id":"dev_018_s0","report_id":"dev_018","text":"Lab Report: Training dynamics of deep models","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s1","report_id":"dev_018","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s2","report_id":"dev_018","text":"All experiments were run on a single GPU with 12 GB of memory.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s3","report_id":"dev_018","text":"We trained each model for 100 epochs with a batch size of 64.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s4","report_id":"dev_018","text":"Figure 1 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s5","report_id":"dev_018","text":"As shown in Figure 1, Transformer reaches 25.7% validation accuracy on AG News.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s6","report_id":"dev_018","text":"On IMDB, MLP is 4.2 points better than EfficientNet.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s7","report_id":"dev_018","text":"MLP achieves over 80% validation accuracy on CIFAR-10 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s8","report_id":"dev_018","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s9","report_id":"dev_018","text":"ViT-S scores 10 points higher on 70 than on 20.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s10","report_id":"dev_018","text":"As shown in Figure 2, ViT-S scores 18.9 points higher on 50 than on 10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s11","report_id":"dev_018","text":"As shown in Figure 2, ViT-S reaches 86.1% F1 score at epoch 70.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s12","report_id":"dev_018","text":"Figure 3 shows the accuracy by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s13","report_id":"dev_018","text":"LSTM achieves 51.4% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s14","report_id":"dev_018","text":"As shown in Figure 3, LSTM achieves 59.6% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s15","report_id":"dev_018","text":"Figure 4 shows the test accuracy of ResNet-18 by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s16","report_id":"dev_018","text":"ResNet-18 reaches over 70% test accuracy on SST-2 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s17","report_id":"dev_018","text":"As shown in Figure 4, ResNet-18 scores 54.6 points higher on MNIST than on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s18","report_id":"dev_018","text":"As shown in Figure 4, ResNet-18 reaches 66% test accuracy on IMDB.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s19","report_id":"dev_018","text":"On CIFAR-10, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 68.9%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_018_s20","report_id":"dev_018","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}